r lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>This workflow helps in limiting embodied carbon in buildings: reducing required material quantities through the optimization of structural form, by using DLT (Dowel Laminated Timber) system. That has been beneficial to create a slab without requiring adhesives and metal </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>fastners</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>, contributing to its circularity.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Slide Number Placeholder 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{EBCB4F2B-18C6-D22F-5B8F-679CC42BBC0B}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldNum" sz="quarter" idx="5"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:fld id="{033833DC-77F7-406E-AE4A-8213B8FABCE8}" type="slidenum"><a:rPr lang="en-US" smtClean="0"/><a:t>15</a:t></a:fld><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="3450248340"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:notes>